<title>PHILIPPINES: RESEARCH ALERT - Hold Mondragon - Dharmala.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hold Mondragon - Dharmala.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokerage Dharmala Securities on Monday recommended a &quot;hold&quot; on Mondragon International saying that despite its expensive price, the firm's Mimosa Casino had very good earnings potential.</p>
</text>
